---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
---

<section class="section-py" aria-labelledby="about-heading" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <SectionHeading
      id="about-heading"
      label="About"
    />

    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-body">
        <p>
          I'm Nikhil — a backend engineer interested in building systems that
          hold up under real conditions. I don't chase frameworks; I try to
          understand the problems they exist to solve.
        </p>
        <p>
          I primarily work with TypeScript and Node.js, building APIs and
          backend services on top of MongoDB, PostgreSQL, and Redis. I've spent
          time thinking about authentication infrastructure, transactional
          correctness, async processing patterns, and how services should talk
          to each other.
        </p>
        <p>
          Right now, I'm deepening my understanding of distributed systems,
          service boundaries, and infrastructure — the kinds of decisions that
          determine how well a system survives at scale or under load.
        </p>
        <p>
          Outside of backend work, I experiment with hardware (ESP32),
          contribute small developer tools, and occasionally explore what it
          means to build well-designed developer experiences.
        </p>
      </div>

      <aside class="about-sidebar" aria-label="Quick facts">
        <div class="sidebar-section">
          <h3 class="sidebar-label">Currently</h3>
          <p class="sidebar-value">Backend Engineering at Medoc Health IT</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sidebar-section">
          <h3 class="sidebar-label">Interested in</h3>
          <ul class="sidebar-list">
            <li>Distributed systems</li>
            <li>Authentication infrastructure</li>
            <li>Database internals</li>
            <li>Backend architecture</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="sidebar-section">
          <h3 class="sidebar-label">Learning</h3>
          <ul class="sidebar-list">
            <li>System design patterns</li>
            <li>Infrastructure tooling</li>
            <li>Performance engineering</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 280px;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.4rem;
  }

  .about-body p {
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 58ch;
  }

  /* Sidebar */
  .about-sidebar {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding-top: 0.2rem;
  }

  .sidebar-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .sidebar-label {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .sidebar-value {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .sidebar-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .sidebar-list li {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    padding-left: 0.75rem;
    position: relative;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .sidebar-list li::before {
    content: '—';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--bg-border);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }
  }
</style>
